        <!-- ===================== GUARANTEES ===================== -->
        <mxCell id="g_box" value="Guarantees — fixed vs. the old prose-only ideas" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="440" y="540" width="430" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g_list" value="1. One canonical idea.md format (inline status), written&#10;    only by basket.py — no drift from loop / report.&#10;&#10;2. findings.md format unified with run_iter + analyze;&#10;    the analyze parser now also tolerates old variants.&#10;&#10;3. Template ships EMPTY — no phantom placeholder&#10;    ideas miscounted or tried.&#10;&#10;4. Status lifecycle pending → doing → selected | discarded,&#10;    updated by the loop via basket.py.&#10;&#10;5. Paper collection is BOUNDED (limit per Execute,&#10;    default 10, user-set) — no runaway search.&#10;&#10;6. Spec-driven: ideas judged against the goal; document&#10;    ideas must align before being added.&#10;&#10;7. Distinct provenance: Human / Paper / Web / Document /&#10;    Idea basket / AI agent.&#10;&#10;8. idea.md · findings.md · idea_basket/ kept git-untracked&#10;    (survive the loop's resets); add is de-duplicated." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="448" y="568" width="414" height="265" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

